@startuml
title Optional services and captured booking prices
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
class AdditionalService {
  name
  unit_price : BigDecimal
  price(quantity:)
}
class BreakfastPackage
class AirportTransfer
class Booking
class BookingService {
  service_type
  quantity
  unit_price
  subtotal() : unit_price * quantity
}
class AdditionalServicePricing {
  {static} total(services)
}
AdditionalService <|-- BreakfastPackage
AdditionalService <|-- AirportTransfer
Booking "1" -- "*" BookingService : belongs_to / has_many
AdditionalServicePricing ..> BookingService : sums subtotal()
note bottom of BookingService
  Captures service type and price as values.
  No association to AdditionalService objects.
end note
note top of AdditionalService
  Instantiable Ruby base class;
  subclasses configure service defaults.
end note
@enduml
